      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انعب</span></b>  (assumed tropical:)  <i>He</i> (a man) <i>cried out,</i> or <i>stretched
out his neck and moved about his head, in disturbances, broils,</i> or <i>the like:</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَعَبَ فِى الفِتَنِ</span>.
